B}}^{w^{\ast \ast }}=\overline{\mathrm{I}_{A}+\mathrm{I}_{B}}^{w^{\ast \ast
}}=\mathrm{I}_{\overline{A}^{w^{\ast \ast }}}+\mathrm{I}_{\overline{B} 
