\partial (\bar{f}^{w^{\ast \ast }}+\mathrm{I}_{rB_{X^{\ast \ast
}}})(z)\subset \tbigcap_{U\in \mathcal{N}}\limfunc{cl}\nolimits^{\left\Vert
\cdot \right\Vert _{\ast }}\left( \tbigcup_{x\in z+U}\left( \partial g(x)+ 
\mathrm{N}_{rB_{X}}(x)\right) \right) ,
